@startuml
' AD-030; source ../use-cases/UC-030-confirm-catalog-item-into-closet.md
' Draft v0.1, 2026-11-09; approved PR #4 / DD-007 scope, not implementation.
' Trace: FEAT-CAT-002; BR-030; CAP-14; PBI-047; US-CAT-002 AC.
' SRS: FR-CAT-005, FR-CAT-006, FR-CAT-007, FR-CAT-008; DATA-CAT-001.
' Business Rules: BRULE-CAT-001/002; BRULE-GAR-001/002/005/006/010; BRULE-AUTH-001/007.
' Open policy: MVP-Q07, MVP-Q09; PRD Section 34.2. No provider / owner allocation selected.
title AD-030 - Confirm a catalog item into the owned closet
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
|User|
start
:Deliberately start UC-030;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Source / affected-user access authorized?) then (Yes)
  :Identify intended source and user context;
else (Denied / unusable)
  :Explain access state; disclose no private data;
  :Offer renewed access or accessible source;
  stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
:Present selected catalog source information for review;
|User|
:Correct / supply actual garment information;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Category and one Color confirmed;
supplied optional values valid / applicable?) then (Yes)
  |User|
  if (Explicitly confirm owned addition?) then (Yes)
    |CapsuleAI|
    :Attempt one logical confirmed addition;
    if (Acceptance established?) then (Yes)
      :Show distinct owner-controlled garment;
      :Preserve accepted values and source provenance;
    else (Failed / uncertain)
      :Show actual failed or unconfirmed outcome;
      :Review accepted outcome before safe same-action retry;
    endif
  else (Cancel)
    |CapsuleAI|
    :Create no garment from canceled intention;
  endif
else (Needs correction)
  :Explain supplied input error / missing minimum;
  :Offer manual correction or cancel; no automatic add;
endif
note right
  Exactly 13 properties; optional Materials / Styles sets.
  Catalog asking price is not personal purchase Price.
  Later source changes cannot overwrite confirmed data.
  Eligibility remains NOT_EVALUATED.
end note

stop
@enduml
